.SH NAME
anx-tools - Manage, execute, and update decoupled developer tools and AI suite


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBanx tools [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
The tools subsystem orchestrates personal and decoupled developer tools (Go, Rust, Python, Bash, Node.js).
Tools can live as standalone external projects in ~/.local/bin or PATH without requiring anx to be recompiled,
while built-in engines (such as aitools) provide zero-dependency standalone fallbacks.


